{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0152_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "f149d9d523350799ad06879c195abb2dfa5b6960a3cc04deb6e9155e304cc4bf", "ja": "プチプラコスメのプロモーション・ユニット\nのメンバーに悩むプロデューサー。ふと育、\n桃子、環の3人を見つけ、これはフックにな\nるかもしれないと思い立つ。小学生3人組の\nユニットが誕生した。", "zh": "为平价彩妆宣传组合的成员人选而烦恼的制作人，偶然发现了育、桃子和环这3人，灵机一动，觉得这或许能成为一个卖点。于是，一个由3名小学生组成的组合诞生了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0152_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_01_1000_p", "source_sha256": "d8afa8720f2a703e4238fe61e89db203588d4beb54fafe454a0df5677982142a", "ja": "（プチプラコスメのプロモーションを兼ねたユニット。\nここに強いフックを仕込むとなると……うーん……）", "zh": "（这是一个兼顾平价彩妆宣传的组合。要在这里加入一个强有力的亮点……嗯……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0152_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_01_1001_p", "source_sha256": "80aabe49372b24805471fed05076c2793bef45eab1ecf5a22cae1f920e09ab33", "ja": "（控室で資料を見ながら、考えてみるか。\n参考になりそうなファッション雑誌も色々あるし）", "zh": "（在休息室里一边看资料，一边想想吧。\n而且还有各种各样可以拿来参考的时尚杂志。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0152_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_01_1002_030iku", "source_sha256": "49d8fe8b5440d98b8ce0f04dbc81a100ce91bacae69d9d2d52fae1f2db94def8", "ja": "『流行色は差し色に使うとグッド』……。\nふんふん……。", "zh": "“流行色可以用来搭配点睛色”……\n嗯嗯……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0152_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_01_1003_p", "source_sha256": "c2f935ee69a84d7eefcef3503b5449cfd61c39c198beb3c7ba5797c712709cd8", "ja": "お、育が先客だったか。お疲れさま、\nファッション雑誌を読んでるのか？", "zh": "哦，育已经先到了啊。辛苦了，你在看时尚杂志吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0152_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_01_1004_030iku", "source_sha256": "64fff7e81a2cbd1985d89b5d2b1c0ccb18698b85c65d60d426d17abd9fc380c2", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}さん、お疲れさま！\n流行をチェックするのは、だいじなことでしょ？", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生，辛苦啦！\n关注流行趋势可是很重要的，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0152_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_01_1005_p", "source_sha256": "a0a802371b2845f4b207b6f88606c64252648ad95562953f162148a5938a3a47", "ja": "はは、勉強熱心でなによりだな。\nそれじゃあ俺も、育を見習って勉強しようかな。", "zh": "哈哈，学习这么认真，真不错。\n那我也向育学习，开始用功吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0152_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_01_1006_030iku", "source_sha256": "0bc5830415a750f37251fbd4cbb968523ceb2bce8ab94583f50f26eb1abcd50a", "ja": "{$P$}さんも、流行のお勉強？\n……あっ、お化粧の道具だね！？", "zh": "{$P$}先生也在学习流行趋势吗？\n……啊，是化妆用的工具吧！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0152_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_01_1007_p", "source_sha256": "ea5293976ba5686cd3d9c0a2833c6ead368a4c91e01a9619df5bc91faff941ce", "ja": "うん、ちょっとこっちの方面にも\n詳しくなっておきたくってな。……あれ？", "zh": "嗯，我想着也稍微多了解一下\n这方面的知识。……咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0152_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_01_1008_p", "source_sha256": "e590bcefd59d9a599fa9e9433bd17983552553ef857ad2a92ef6e00e480c8a97", "ja": "つけまつげが、ひとつ見当たらないな……。\nさっき見た時は確かにあったのに……。", "zh": "假睫毛好像少了一只……  \n刚才看的时候明明还在……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0152_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_01_1009_040tam", "source_sha256": "ed7ea300dac8ced6d069e4918bf4d2b752d3e9e055e12b62a1e94347168bbdcf", "ja": "あっ！　育に、おやぶんだ！\nねえ、きいてきいて～！", "zh": "啊！育，亲爱的大哥来了！\n听我说，听我说～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0152_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_01_1010_030iku", "source_sha256": "5d87e7e1eb7d6ebd0cedd3d5195202a2c3985d0bdfabb0899501f36841597fd7", "ja": "お疲れさま、環ちゃん。\nどうかしたの？", "zh": "辛苦了，环。\n怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0152_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_01_1011_040tam", "source_sha256": "51222b4d9dac1145ebfcd65b660cb726a972d6ac867f300e9e45c41eab889bd4", "ja": "たまき、そこの廊下で\nめずらしい虫見つけたんだ！", "zh": "环在那边的走廊上发现了一只稀奇的虫子！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0152_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_01_1012_p", "source_sha256": "d5009499d8b9fee8aa68d730c3936dc87577b386f3b07296415bab6e8c383ac4", "ja": "虫？　……あ、わかった！\n環、それは虫じゃなくて、つけまつげ……。", "zh": "虫子？……啊，我知道了！環，那不是虫子，是假睫毛……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0152_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_01_1013_null", "source_sha256": "a53f2959d0bd67a87b22869328255deac5a9c088662ec6bbdf1229e418a7d843", "ja": "ブウン……！", "zh": "嗡……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0152_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_01_1014_p", "source_sha256": "2c068a0a1463178f7a8aef39dbeec0026bd9a3ea62ed8560aede9d20fed13c09", "ja": "うわあ！？\n虫！　本当に虫！", "zh": "哇啊！？\n虫子！真的是虫子！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0152_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_01_1015_040tam", "source_sha256": "1a84f8910f951e17934b004a1df7c21d6073b899e693763c8fe939612c038fd4", "ja": "あ、待って！　うう、せっかく捕まえたのに\n逃げられちゃった……。", "zh": "啊，等等！呜，好不容易才抓到的……结果还是让它逃掉了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0152_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_01_1016_p", "source_sha256": "573a990485a21d0d9dee79cd01280fcc7e703f60582312ae33e80664a446583c", "ja": "び、びっくりした……。てっきり、\n虫と間違えてつけまつげを拾ったとばかり……。", "zh": "吓、吓我一跳……我还以为桃子把假睫毛当成虫，捡起来了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0152_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_01_1017_049mom", "source_sha256": "7a7b53057e80c2fbc08b627782c01718ab0d72aa9917c3aa95db23c5140bee6d", "ja": "それなら、さっき桃子が拾ったよ。\n環が虫を捕まえてる時にね。", "zh": "既然这样，刚才是桃子捡到的。\n在环抓虫子的时候。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0152_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_01_1018_p", "source_sha256": "e21d2b38d0945c0c38cf04b747eb3794e6848378a90538a442135fed43d3335d", "ja": "あっ、桃子！\n拾ってくれてありがとう、助かったよ。", "zh": "啊，桃子！\n谢谢你帮我捡起来，帮大忙了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0152_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_01_1019_049mom", "source_sha256": "c807f57e0f026a24732aea285286a2dfe1fb973b8bcb46cf6c3c0e208e72fa56", "ja": "いいけど……ねえ、お兄ちゃん。机の上に置いてある\nのって、つけまつげと同じブランドのコスメ？", "zh": "没关系啦……我说，大哥哥。桌上放着的那些，\n是跟假睫毛同个品牌的化妆品吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0152_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_01_1020_p", "source_sha256": "308eb9c7193dce667ca9da2d8d953382011b0bce19923213b7c1c5d640082da9", "ja": "ああ、そうだよ。仕事のための資料なんだけど、\n色々勉強してるところで……。", "zh": "嗯，是的。是工作用的资料，不过我也正在学习各种东西……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0152_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_01_1021_049mom", "source_sha256": "9efaa4bff0520f9d9809ae38b0a3e8accfe9aca33b62bf2012e0aec06e6c3cc2", "ja": "ふーん……リップ、かわいい色がそろってる。\nお兄ちゃんにしては、いいセンスだね♪", "zh": "嗯……这些口红的颜色都好可爱。以哥哥来说，品味还不错嘛♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0152_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_01_1022_030iku", "source_sha256": "f709c4ae427aa5613e5443dc388f265a6274dff9f36f83db80fd14a0640e7bd1", "ja": "わたしも、かわいいなって思ってたんだ！\nこの赤とか、環ちゃんに似合うんじゃない？", "zh": "我也觉得很可爱呀！像这个红色，就很适合环吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0152_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_01_1023_040tam", "source_sha256": "fdfc8ab0980170a27891764b69c594f302009ac7098c2013c660a68d06f46f33", "ja": "たまきはよくわからないけど……あ！　これ、\nレッドの赤みたいにピカピカでかっこいい！", "zh": "环环也不太明白……啊！这个，\n像红色的红一样闪闪发亮，好帅气！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0152_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_01_1024_p", "source_sha256": "3bef3d8a3a0f6790100fc1be35d1de753472594d1b184c92a9bea3bb995735e9", "ja": "（そうか……今時は小学生でも、結構コスメに\n詳しいんだな。ましてや、3人はアイドル……）", "zh": "（原来如此……现在的小学生也挺懂化妆品的嘛。\n更何况，3人还是偶像……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0152_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_01_1025_049mom", "source_sha256": "b0fd51b7ac0eef324b6257f42f84ee117be5c9522c334bdca841bc9d727d0b42", "ja": "環はオレンジも似合うよね。\nこっちのグロスなんかも、いいと思うけどな。", "zh": "环也很适合橙色呢。\n我觉得这边的唇彩也挺不错的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0152_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_01_1026_030iku", "source_sha256": "5aebfc0f1c2fb742d4c72161615b9025775d6082187cb833d07eabb565dc980f", "ja": "わあ……キラキラしてる！\nわたしなら……こっちの、ピンクが好きかな♪", "zh": "哇……闪闪发光的！\n如果是我的话……我喜欢这边的粉色♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0152_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_01_1027_p", "source_sha256": "b90b9a571508244fe37c76e396a7b203f503c0b4209c64daac79a20c2c87236a", "ja": "（想像してなかったけど、この3人の組み合わせ……。\n盲点だったかも……！）", "zh": "（虽然之前没想过，但这3人的组合……或许是我忽略的可能性……！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0152_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_01_1028_p", "source_sha256": "ce13a44d2fbf5f457aca1630c7caf8befca16e5477909b15f19084be9221bdfb", "ja": "環、育、桃子。ちょっと3人に\n聞いてもらいたい話があるんだけど……。", "zh": "环、育、桃子。我有件事想请你们3人听一下……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0152_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_01_1029_040tam", "source_sha256": "196bfd8bfc459dc7305654c0df8899815a79339854e5de55cad44cac5339a944", "ja": "話……？", "zh": "什么事……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0152_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_01_1032_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0152_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_01_1034_030iku", "source_sha256": "6967607d630b23bec22b39b88ca53d1e0b45b79f4f53ad69976650f0940da0b5", "ja": "わあ……♪　すっごく、大人っぽい雰囲気の曲だね！\nステキ！", "zh": "哇……♪这首歌的氛围特别成熟呢！\n好棒！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0152_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_01_1035_049mom", "source_sha256": "52de8e407bfbe625576e15f45e6f0779e20e713f1f825ec2a5de382dccbd8ceb", "ja": "ふーん、こういう曲を桃子たちにまかせるんだ……\nお兄ちゃん、いろいろわかってきたみたいだね♪", "zh": "嗯——让桃子她们来唱这种风格的歌啊……\n哥哥，你好像渐渐懂得怎么安排了呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0152_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_01_1036_p", "source_sha256": "3caaff1242c6a93ec7143bb202230a93d9eb908b4f44d16fe9e85c640b91e2e3", "ja": "環はどうだ？　気に入ったか？", "zh": "环觉得怎么样？喜欢吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0152_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_01_1037_040tam", "source_sha256": "e8957fd9e38e1eaa167d410a82fd55bb80bf8d897ecfe98d8d889279885c9acc", "ja": "うん、すっごくかっこよかった！\nたまき、育とももこと一緒に歌ってみたい！", "zh": "嗯，超级帅气的！\n环想和育还有桃子一起唱唱看！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0152_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_01_1038_p", "source_sha256": "f224e8a40f52e839876fb2d7c986fe94472e0c5171b0c1a3f90a23b023fe7241", "ja": "良かった、3人とも気に入ったみたいだな！\nよし、今回の仕事は環、育、桃子のユニットでいこう！", "zh": "太好了，看来3个人都很喜欢嘛！好，这次的工作就让环、育和桃子组成组合来做吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0152_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_01_1039_049mom", "source_sha256": "aa24a9ae053ed27d509817e4e380b7a567266b8dbc51ed29acbf9fff0ae640f9", "ja": "環と育と、桃子のユニットか……ふふっ。", "zh": "环、育，还有桃子的组合啊……呵呵。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0152_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_01_1040_030iku", "source_sha256": "58e2d280928909fe85578d8f14b9c64a988f86e18b8496d5510807062a71c0de", "ja": "わたしたち3人でユニットなんて、\nうれしいな！　ね、桃子ちゃん！", "zh": "我们3个人组成组合，真开心！对吧，桃子！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0152_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_01_1041_049mom", "source_sha256": "32c1648a380e14989fcd7971da52410a02d292b43bdba160b8cdd41371e0e4e9", "ja": "も、桃子は別に……\nいつもどおり、カンペキにお仕事をこなすだけだよ。", "zh": "桃、桃子倒是无所谓……\n只要和平常一样，完美地完成工作就好啦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0152_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_01_1042_049mom", "source_sha256": "444b9a4843921a1f03a4e5af70bad9244a5cf931fb2ec9a3c2d218759de924c5", "ja": "それよりお兄ちゃん、ユニットなんでしょ？\nリーダーは、もう決めたの？", "zh": "比起那个，哥哥，你们是要组队吧？\n队长已经决定好了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0152_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_01_1043_p", "source_sha256": "b1a46c95ccae223c4db6de918e07462623f2969c4cebc1702112d5cc1324daf9", "ja": "リーダーは……任せるとしたら、環かな？\n年齢的に、一番お姉さんだしな。", "zh": "队长的话……要交给谁，我想大概是环吧？\n毕竟从年龄上来说，她是最年长的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0152_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_01_1044_040tam", "source_sha256": "d47143e27ee8dcba5dbcc1711f6b11f56d90ef7677e53a761f58fdb74e204e1c", "ja": "やったー！　たまきがリーダーでレッド！\nまたレッドがやれるぞ～、くふふ♪", "zh": "太好了！环当队长，红队！\n又能当红队了～咕呼呼♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0152_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_01_1045_049mom", "source_sha256": "6bfd3df38158207817f021a51d252d3696a7748552f3abfd43a4505346dd5be0", "ja": "ちょっと、お兄ちゃん。\n年齢って……適当に決めてるんじゃないでしょうね？", "zh": "等一下，哥哥。\n年龄……该不会是随便定的吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0152_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_01_1046_p", "source_sha256": "032098025d77dffb82bf12797609d9e4b1738d38857847fa6e1de69b301d1f7d", "ja": "いやいや、そんなことないぞ。\n環、今回はセンターと違って、3人のユニットだ。", "zh": "不不，才没有那回事。\n环，这次和Center不一样，是3人的组合。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0152_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_01_1047_p", "source_sha256": "9155b35eb8e75ff6e56847077a143a581297ae0899c7a537ddb9bcd24bb2e76c", "ja": "育と桃子のいいところを活かして、まとめるのが\nユニットのリーダーの仕事だ。できそうか？", "zh": "发挥育和桃子的优点，把大家团结起来，就是组合队长的职责。你能做到吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0152_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_01_1048_040tam", "source_sha256": "c4d16276b5e92e5ab60872217a67461bf6bba44b29d0586d5e31ec904b58d4cd", "ja": "育とももこの、いいところ……。\nわかった！　たまき、やってみる！", "zh": "育和桃子的优点……我明白了！环会努力试试的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0152_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_01_1049_p", "source_sha256": "c075d042424596b72635029cdc1954179d302cf4a44d2c622f26f5e5086655fe", "ja": "よし、いい返事だ！　でも、困った事があったら、\nそういう時はすぐ知らせるんだぞ。約束だ。", "zh": "好，回答得不错！不过要是遇到什么麻烦，要马上告诉我。约好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0152_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_01_1050_040tam", "source_sha256": "d20a15aed9a87a4ff9bec7b0b9b3926a0d2c70edf67dd731eeeae848168fcb06", "ja": "うん！　たまき、3人のリーダーがんばるぞ～！\nくふふ♪", "zh": "嗯！环会好好当3个人的队长加油的～！\n嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0152_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_01_1051_p", "source_sha256": "84b2855781382df917390a343fc50cd5f0ce1feff294a8074c67617aded3fae3", "ja": "（小学生3人組の、プチプラコスメユニット……。\nこれは面白い形になってくれそうだぞ！）", "zh": "（由3名小学生组成的平价美妆组合……\n感觉会发展成很有意思的形式呢！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
